error[E0277]: `Param<i32>` cannot be used as a node input
 --> tests/ui/fail/08_owned_dataset.rs:8:14
  |
8 |     let _n = Node {
  |              ^^^^ not a node input
  |
  = help: the trait `DatasetInput` is not implemented for `Param<i32>`
  = note: input tuples hold dataset *references*: write `(&catalog.field,)`, not `(catalog.field,)`
  = note: adapters such as `EachField` are also valid input slots
  = help: the following other types implement trait `DatasetInput`:
            &T
            EachField<'_, S, D>
  = note: required for `(Param<i32>,)` to implement `NodeInput`
